NOTE ON DATA

This license covers the code and the analysis in this repository.

`data/dataset.csv` contains numeric evaluation results extracted from publicly
published Hugging Face model cards by RedHatAI. Those are measurements of fact
rather than creative expression. The underlying model cards are NOT
redistributed here; they remain under their own licenses (Apache-2.0, MIT, and
the Llama and Gemma community licenses, varying per model). See data/README.md
for how to fetch them yourself.
